* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_rldc (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): residual load curve
* constraints (resloadc.vda: the preparation from prep_ext.vda L38, COEF from ppm_ext.vda L12, the
* equations EQ_RL_LOAD, EQ_RL_NDIS, EQ_RL_STCAP, EQ_RL_PKCAP and EQ_RL_THMIN from equ_ext.vda L102;
* M1.3 change 55, docs/m13-plan.md), added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86,
* CC BY 4.0), in REG1:
* - GR_VARGEN: the variance of the residual load (RL-DISP), of wind (annual and winter, so the
*   levelling of L47-49 acts) and of solar, and RL-THMIN; RL-TP starts the constraints in 2010.
* - GR_GENMAP: wind, solar and run-of-river hydro by plant, and the oil plant as dispatchable
*   (its production is the dispatchable term of EQ_RL_LOAD).
* - GR_THMIN: the thermal minimum of the coal plant (0.4: a LO share), of the gas plant (1.5: an
*   UP share 1/1.5) and of the new gas plant (-0.2: a fixed level).
* - RLDBAT, a daynite battery of electricity, for the storage terms.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC
/
RLDBAT 'Crafted: daynite battery of electricity (TIMES.jl demo12_rldc)'
/

SET COM_GRP
/
RLDBAT_NRGO
/

SET COM_GMAP
/
REG1.RLDBAT_NRGO.ELC
/

SET PRC_MAP
/
REG1.STG.RLDBAT
/

SET PRC_TSL
/
REG1.RLDBAT.DAYNITE
/

SET PRC_ACTUNT
/
REG1.RLDBAT.RLDBAT_NRGO.PJ
/

SET TOP
/
REG1.RLDBAT.ELC.IN
REG1.RLDBAT.ELC.OUT
/

PARAMETER
STG_EFF ' '/
REG1.2005.RLDBAT 0.9
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.RLDBAT.MEURO05 2
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.RLDBAT 15
/

PARAMETER
GR_VARGEN ' '/
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-DISP.UP 0.05
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-WIND.UP 0.3
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-WIND.LO 0.2
REG1.W.RL-WIND.UP 0.4
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-SOL.LO 0.1
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-THMIN.LO 1
REG1.ANNUAL.RL-TP.LO 2010
/

PARAMETER
GR_GENMAP ' '/
REG1.ELCREWIN00.RL-WIND 1
REG1.ELCRESOL00.RL-SOL 1
REG1.ELCREHYD00.RL-ROR 1
REG1.ELCTEOIL00.RL-DISP 1
/

PARAMETER
GR_THMIN ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00 0.4
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00 1.5
REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01 -0.2
/
